            <fr:title text="Universal Property of IsoFiber">Universal Property of IsoFiber</fr:title>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p><fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {IsoFiber_{F}}]]></fr:tex> has the universal property that a global section of
it comprises the same data as a section of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F]]></fr:tex>. That is, a section of
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {IsoFiber_{F}}]]></fr:tex> gives the ingredients to construct a functor <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[G : \mathcal {D}
\to  \mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> such that <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F \circ  G \cong  \mathsf {Id}]]></fr:tex>.
</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
